&scene=126&sessionid=1795528935#rd","description":"「VP≠VNP」 是代数复杂性理论中一个有 47 年历史的核心问题，常叫「代数版P vs NP」。\n\n通俗说：算一个矩阵的积和式，任何算术电路需要的门数都会随规模超多项式增长——这类问题天生就难算。\n\n而 Anthropic 公开了一篇 70 页的论文，声称证明 VP≠VNP，还用 Lean 4 写出了形式化证明，论文与代码都已公开。\n\n如何评价？这是不是意味着，距离证明 P≠NP 又近了一步？","content":"<p>「VP≠VNP」 是代数复杂性理论中一个有 47 年历史的核心问题，常叫「代数版P vs NP」。<br /><br />通俗说：算一个矩阵的积和式，任何算术电路需要的门数都会随规模超多项式增长——这类问题天生就难算。<br /><br />而 Anthropic 公开了一篇 70 页的论文，声称证明 VP≠VNP，还用 Lean 4 写出了形式化证明，论文与代码都已公开。<br /><br />如何评价？这是不是意味着，距离证明 P≠NP 又近了一步？</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FkrSqjDRWFlF5jwy1yCjXe2NMPib66Ricpp6g1dJPNwZ8X4Shc2KJRwNjy19gk17pgcA4FXibNnWlzLHiciaoggph9MB0lYq8tM5HIV2XfzCLulibs%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FkrSqjDRWFlFsS4icJ6p7qTljXOjRzeRJxNOmiabV5yXvxNC6tVdO50fLo6FfIbRtH72xBvaoBQFj4HP2BADSZjicM8EX7xpILsCy48ljTKJAlI%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FkrSqjDRWFlGSR12QcgryicT1KBgJqUkPsm9FxouRf8xpLbFYU2blBRiaeSTibhbDeYNia9H1nQxKBX1HRIHI3SLzyGwF8tpfx2HG5rtxparthSE%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FkrSqjDRWFlEOxibtQiaib32g02M7wUhtCfBficeEXFu9QMPW3VyOb76qvQy1yWlsADR03z59aiacy0chCV5NYrxD0BCzExQ7cEFpEIOibibwM2MKfI%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","images":["http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FkrSqjDRWFlF5jwy1yCjXe2NMPib66Ricpp6g1dJPNwZ8X4Shc2KJRwNjy19gk17pgcA4FXibNnWlzLHiciaoggph9MB0lYq8tM5HIV2XfzCLulibs%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FkrSqjDRWFlFsS4icJ6p7qTljXOjRzeRJxNOmiabV5yXvxNC6tVdO50fLo6FfIbRtH72xBvaoBQFj4HP2BADSZjicM8EX7xpILsCy48ljTKJAlI%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2